     4	 * What the item-specific risk surcharges of a policy add up to.
     5	 *
     6	 * The office assesses each insured item on its own -- a curse raises the premium of the
     7	 * cursed item, not of its harmless neighbours -- and the policy carries the sum.
     8	 */
